# The build context is 15 MB, most of it dead. `/app/models` is a declared
# VOLUME, so anything copied there seeds a fresh trader_models volume — which
# meant 16 legacy per-coin .joblib artefacts from the deleted classifier
# pipeline appeared in a new deployment's models directory, where the promotion
# machinery treats that directory as authoritative.
models/
optimization_results/
data/
logs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
features/
.pytest_cache/
.git/
.env
.env.*
